      {
        "text": "Shirley N. Weber is the California Secretary of State. She was appointed in 2021 and elected to a full term in 2022. Before holding statewide office, she served four terms in the State Assembly representing the San Diego area and chaired the Assembly Elections and Redistricting Committee. She also served on the San Diego Unified School District board and was a professor of Africana Studies at San Diego State University.",
        "cites": [1],
